 "paragraphs": [
  "After their picnic, Aliya and Zade went off to play. They came across a young falcon. The falcon was in tears. “Hi, are you okay?” Zade asked. “No, I can’t find the party,” the young falcon answered. “What party?” Aliya questioned. “Every year, I attend a party with my parents to celebrate the blooming of our cherished yellow flower, the hyacinth, but I lost my way.”"
 ],
